      "body": "# [Fix] Preserve caller-owned hidden_states in DeepGemm standard pre-permute\n\n## Motivation\n\nFixes #32056.\n\n`pre_permute_standard_to_deep_gemm` unconditionally calls\n`dispose_tensor(hidden_states_ref)` after repacking tokens into the\nexpert-major DeepGEMM buffers. `dispose_tensor` shrinks the storage in\nplace, so the caller's `hidden_states` reference is destroyed even when the\nrunner was invoked with `inplace=False`.\n\nModels that re-use `hidden_states` after the routed experts return break:\nQwen3.5 / Qwen2-MoE-style shared-expert blocks compute the shared-expert\nbranch and its sigmoid gate from the same tensor\n(`fused_gate_sigmoid_mul_add` in `qwen2_moe.py`) and crash on the first MoE\nlayer with `--moe-runner-backend deep_gemm`.\n\n## Modifications\n\nGate the disposal on `runner_config.inplace`, which is the existing\nownership contract (`inplace=True` = runner may consume the input):\n\n```python\n    if runner_config.inplace:\n        dispose_tensor(hidden_states_ref)\n```\n\n- `inplace=True` (default; models without a shared expert): behavior\n  unchanged, the activation is still released early to save memory.\n- `inplace=False` (shared-expert models such as Qwen3.5): the caller's\n  tensor stays intact and the shared-expert gate works.\n\nThe DeepEP pre-permute path is untouched — it owns its dispatched tensor and\nmay keep disposing unconditionally.\n\n## Accuracy / performance\n\n- Verified end-to-end on Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-FP8 (TP8/EP8,\n  `--moe-runner-backend deep_gemm`): previously crashed with\n  `ValueError` in the shared-expert gate on the first MoE layer, now runs\n  correctly with outputs matching the triton runner baseline.\n- No behavior change for `inplace=True` callers; the early disposal (memory\n  optimization) is preserved on that path.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code with pre-commit.\n- [x] Add unit tests / verified end-to-end as described above.\n- [x] Update documentation as needed. (N/A)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #30343789068](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30343789068)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #30343790716](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30343790716)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
